/*
 * Implements semantic validation for class constructors.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of constructor prototypes,
 *   - detection of conflicting constructor overloads,
 *   - integration of validated constructors into the class reference,
 *   - validation of template constructors,
 *   - synthesis of default constructors for movable entities,
 *   - synthesis of constructors built from the fields of a class,
 *   - enforcement of initialization rules for fields,
 *   - insertion of constructor symbols into the class's add-method list.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::ctor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/ctor.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
